    "q-71447": {
      "dom_id": "step-q71447",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "The intersection of the planes $x+2y-4z+6=0$ and $x-4y+2z=0$ is given by the line\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨0,{a}_{2},{a}_{3}⟩+tb,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nCalculate ${a}_{2}+{a}_{3},$ and find a possible direction vector $b.$",
      "worked_solution": "We're given that there exists a point on the line where $x=0.$ Substituting this into the second equation gives \n\n$$\n0-4y+2z=0\\,⟹\\,z=2y,\n$$\n\nand substituting $x=0$ and $z=2y$ into the first equation gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+2y-4z+6 & =0 \\\\ 0+2y-4(2y)+6 & =0 \\\\ -6y & =-6 \\\\ y & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $z=2y=2$ and $a=⟨0,1,2⟩$ is a position vector of a point on the line.\n\nNext, we notice:\n\n- For the plane $x+2y-4z+6=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨1,2,-4⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $x-4y+2z=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨1,-4,2⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} & =⟨1,2,-4⟩\\times ⟨1,-4,2⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 2\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-12i-6j-6k \\\\  & =⟨-12,-6,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can pick any vector that is parallel to ${n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2}$ as a direction vector of the line. So, let \n \n\n$$\nb=-\\frac{1}{6}({n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2})=⟨2,1,1⟩.\n$$\n\n \n\nHence, the equation of the line is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =a+tb \\\\ r(t) & =⟨0,1,2⟩+t⟨2,1,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then, ${a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=1+2=3,$ and $b=⟨2,1,1⟩.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-71447-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=6,\\,b=⟨1,3,6⟩",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"150\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> "
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-71447-b",
